{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":2051401,"name":"Andrew Bernard","username":"Andro","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/meta.discourse.org/andro/{size}/173721_2.png","created_at":"2026-10-15T07:45:30.235Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eI have not enabled any Ai features as far as I am aware. But suddenly there are a whole lot of bot accounts i did not create. These appeared after the latest set of updates. Why did these get created and how can I get rid of them? I have no need of Ai for the forum.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":6,"updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:45:30.235Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":4,"reads":49,"readers_count":48,"score":104.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":414747,"topic_slug":"unwanted-bots","display_username":"Andrew Bernard","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":3}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":76501,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/unwanted-bots/414747/1","locale":"en","is_localized":false,"language":"en","customer_flair_customer":null,"event":null,"calendar_details":[],"reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":3}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":3,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":2051405,"name":"Nick","username":"nickdb","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/meta.discourse.org/nickdb/{size}/444510_2.png","created_at":"2026-10-15T07:58:43.789Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eThey are part of the build whether you use them or not, recently a single account for the agent was broken out to individual ones for the relevant features.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003caside class=\"onebox githubpullrequest\" data-onebox-src=\"https://github.com/discourse/discourse/pull/43676\"\u003e\n  \u003cheader class=\"source\"\u003e\n\n      \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/discourse/discourse/pull/43676\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003egithub.com/discourse/discourse\u003c/a\u003e\n  \u003c/header\u003e\n\n  \u003carticle class=\"onebox-body\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"github-row --gh-status-merged\" data-github-private-repo=\"false\"\u003e\n\n\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"github-icon-container\" title=\"Merged Pull Request\"\u003e\n      \u003csvg width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"github-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M11 11.28V5c-.03-.78-.34-1.47-.94-2.06C9.46 2.35 8.78 2.03 8 2H7V0L4 3l3 3V4h1c.27.02.48.11.69.31.21.2.3.42.31.69v6.28A1.993 1.993 0 0 0 10 15a1.993 1.993 0 0 0 1-3.72zm-1 2.92c-.66 0-1.2-.55-1.2-1.2 0-.65.55-1.2 1.2-1.2.65 0 1.2.55 1.2 1.2 0 .65-.55 1.2-1.2 1.2zM4 3c0-1.11-.89-2-2-2a1.993 1.993 0 0 0-1 3.72v6.56A1.993 1.993 0 0 0 2 15a1.993 1.993 0 0 0 1-3.72V4.72c.59-.34 1-.98 1-1.72zm-.8 10c0 .66-.55 1.2-1.2 1.2-.65 0-1.2-.55-1.2-1.2 0-.65.55-1.2 1.2-1.2.65 0 1.2.55 1.2 1.2zM2 4.2C1.34 4.2.8 3.65.8 3c0-.65.55-1.2 1.2-1.2.65 0 1.2.55 1.2 1.2 0 .65-.55 1.2-1.2 1.2z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"github-info-container\"\u003e\n\n\n\n      \u003ch4\u003e\n        \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/discourse/discourse/pull/43676\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eFEATURE: Separate AI agent identity from models (#43676)\u003c/a\u003e\n      \u003c/h4\u003e\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"branches\"\u003e\n      \u003ccode\u003emain\u003c/code\u003e ← \u003ccode\u003eai-llm\u003c/code\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n\n      \u003cdiv class=\"github-info\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"date\"\u003e\n          merged \u003cspan class=\"discourse-local-date\" data-format=\"ll\" data-date=\"2026-10-08\" data-time=\"20:56:25\" data-timezone=\"UTC\"\u003e08:56PM - 08 Oct 26 UTC\u003c/span\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n\n        \u003cdiv class=\"user\"\u003e\n          \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/SamSaffron\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\n            \u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/meta/original/4X/3/9/6/39614a95587f188948fc68dc987145e22fb0cf34.png\" class=\"onebox-avatar-inline\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-dominant-color=\"D1C4B5\"\u003e\n            SamSaffron\n          \u003c/a\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n\n        \u003cdiv class=\"lines\" title=\"4 commits changed 134 files with 3765 additions and 1304 deletions\"\u003e\n          \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/discourse/discourse/pull/43676/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\n            \u003cspan class=\"added\"\u003e+3765\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003cspan class=\"removed\"\u003e-1304\u003c/span\u003e\n          \u003c/a\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"github-row\"\u003e\n    \u003cp class=\"github-body-container\"\u003eUse agents as conversation recipients and select language models\nindependently. \u003cspan class=\"show-more-container\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://github.com/discourse/discourse/pull/43676\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" class=\"show-more\"\u003e…\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"excerpt hidden\"\u003eResolve and validate agent/model choices across personal\nmessages, chat, and streamed replies, retaining them for follow-ups.\n\nRetire model companion-user creation and username lookup while preserving\nhistorical bot attribution. Show agent and model identity on replies and\nshared conversations, and update selectors and regression coverage.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003c/div\u003e\n\n  \u003c/article\u003e\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"onebox-metadata\"\u003e\n    \n    \n  \u003c/div\u003e\n\n  \u003cdiv style=\"clear: both\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/aside\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eSomething I also noticed. If the system will let you, can’t see why you can’t remove them and their dependencies, if you will never use them.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt’s something that is becoming integral to the platform, I couldn’t imagine anti-spam without the AI agent..\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":2,"post_type":1,"posts_count":6,"updated_at":"2026-10-15T08:00:01.588Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":49,"readers_count":48,"score":74.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":414747,"topic_slug":"unwanted-bots","display_username":"Nick","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://github.com/discourse/discourse/pull/43676","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"FEATURE: Separate AI agent identity from models by SamSaffron · Pull Request #43676 · discourse/discourse · GitHub","clicks":5}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":2}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":155653,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/unwanted-bots/414747/2","locale":"en","is_localized":false,"language":"en","customer_flair_customer":null,"event":null,"reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":2}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":2,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":2051482,"name":"","username":"satonotdead","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/meta.discourse.org/satonotdead/{size}/447830_2.png","created_at":"2026-10-15T13:13:06.439Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eI still think it would be great to be able to use just one user for all the AI bots.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKeeping them separated by agent makes using them from chat or personal message users extremely complicated.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":4,"post_type":1,"posts_count":6,"updated_at":"2026-10-15T13:13:06.439Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":31,"readers_count":30,"score":16.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":414747,"topic_slug":"unwanted-bots","display_username":"","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"Plugin Author","title_is_group":false,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":71041,"hidden":false,"trust_level":3,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/unwanted-bots/414747/4","locale":"en","is_localized":false,"language":"en","customer_flair_customer":null,"event":null,"reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":2051528,"name":"Nick","username":"nickdb","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/meta.discourse.org/nickdb/{size}/444510_2.png","created_at":"2026-10-15T14:11:49.121Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eYou could just create your own agent and bind the required, built-in, discourse tools to it.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI am also a fan of the less-is-more philosophy but there is something to be said about the agentic approach, being task-specific. Makes accuracy and consistency better imo.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":6,"updated_at":"2026-10-15T14:11:49.121Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":4,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":28,"readers_count":27,"score":25.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":414747,"topic_slug":"unwanted-bots","display_username":"Nick","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"reply_to_user":{"id":71041,"username":"satonotdead","name":"","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/meta.discourse.org/satonotdead/{size}/447830_2.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":1}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":155653,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/unwanted-bots/414747/5","locale":"en","is_localized":false,"language":"en","customer_flair_customer":null,"event":null,"reactions":[{"id":"+1","type":"emoji","count":1}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":1,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":2051964,"name":"Sam Saffron","username":"sam","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/meta.discourse.org/sam/{size}/102149_2.png","created_at":"2026-10-16T03:25:16.696Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eThis change is deliberate.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe used to create users per language model, this is very confusing and was very hard to explain.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInstead we now create a user for \u003cstrong\u003eevery\u003c/strong\u003e AI agent that has \u003ccode\u003eAI Bot\u003c/code\u003e enabled. This is a far easier to explain state of affairs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou have a user for “forum helper” cause you are allowing users to talk to “forum helper”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI know this was disruptive, but at least the current new state of affairs is a lot easier to explain.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":6,"post_type":1,"posts_count":6,"updated_at":"2026-10-16T03:25:16.696Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":15,"readers_count":14,"score":8.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":414747,"topic_slug":"unwanted-bots","display_username":"Sam Saffron","primary_group_name":"team","flair_name":"team","flair_url":"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/meta/original/3X/e/b/ebee30bd98aef20357e4a177a5a1e45b877ce088.svg","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"111","flair_group_id":47,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"co-founder","title_is_group":false,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":1,"hidden":false,"trust_level":3,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/unwanted-bots/414747/6","locale":"en","is_localized":false,"language":"en","customer_flair_customer":null,"event":null,"reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":2051973,"name":"","username":"satonotdead","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/meta.discourse.org/satonotdead/{size}/447830_2.png","created_at":"2026-10-16T05:02:07.897Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eYeah, I understand there are technical limitations from time to time and the current new state of affairs is better than the original. I am grateful for all the effort the Core Team put into it.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI ended up adding Jev and using a Senior Bot to delegate tasks to subagents. This was not possible before, and I am happy testing it.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":7,"post_type":1,"posts_count":6,"updated_at":"2026-10-16T05:02:07.897Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":12,"readers_count":11,"score":7.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":414747,"topic_slug":"unwanted-bots","display_username":"","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"Plugin Author","title_is_group":false,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":71041,"hidden":false,"trust_level":3,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/unwanted-bots/414747/7","locale":"en","is_localized":false,"language":"en","customer_flair_customer":null,"event":null,"reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null}],"stream":[2051401,2051405,2051482,2051528,2051964,2051973]},"timeline_lookup":[[1,1],[5,0]],"suggested_topics":[],"tags":[],"tags_descriptions":{},"fancy_title":"Unwanted bots","fancy_title_localized":false,"locale":"en","id":414747,"title":"Unwanted bots","posts_count":6,"created_at":"2026-10-15T07:45:30.131Z","views":113,"reply_count":1,"like_count":6,"last_posted_at":"2026-10-16T05:02:07.897Z","visible":true,"closed":false,"archived":false,"has_summary":false,"archetype":"regular","slug":"unwanted-bots","category_id":6,"word_coun